<title>USA: Vivus VVUS approves 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Vivus VVUS approves 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vivus Inc said Wednesday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable June 23, record June 2.</p>
<p>The pharmaceutical company said the split is subject to shareholder approval at the annual meeting May 22.</p>
